  "briefing": "Tidewater Consortium holds Congo Basin through its freight sidings. Reconnect 2 relays, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 7 enemy agents and 3 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Congo Basin Uplink: Tidewater Consortium runs Congo Basin from its freight sidings, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Congo Basin wakes up with the freight sidings in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Congo Basin before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
